msgid "more"
msgstr "lagi"

msgid "Press Shift + N to view notifications"
msgstr "Tekan Shift + N untuk melihat notifikasi"

msgid "Sleep prevented by an active process"
msgstr "Mode tidur dicegah oleh proses aktif"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Beranda"

msgid "Resources"
msgstr "Sumber Daya"

msgid "Extension Repo"
msgstr "Repositori Ekstensi"

msgid "Open on GitHub"
msgstr "Buka di GitHub"

msgid "Enjoying this extension?"
msgstr "Menikmati ekstensi ini?"

msgid "Consider supporting its development!"
msgstr "Pertimbangkan untuk mendukung pengembangannya!"

msgid "Ko-fi"
msgstr "Ko-fi"

msgid "Open Ko-fi"
msgstr "Buka Ko-fi"

msgid "Saweria"
msgstr "Saweria"

msgid "Open Saweria"
msgstr "Buka Saweria"

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

msgid "General"
msgstr "Umum"

msgid "Date Style"
msgstr "Gaya Tanggal"

msgid "Choose between shortened and full date names."
msgstr "Pilih antara nama tanggal yang dipersingkat atau lengkap."

msgid "Short"
msgstr "Singkat"

msgid "Full"
msgstr "Lengkap"

msgid "Cursor Blinking"
msgstr "Kedipan Kursor"

msgid "Enable or disable text cursor blinking in the password field."
msgstr "Aktifkan atau nonaktifkan kedipan kursor teks di kolom kata sandi."

msgid "Custom Lockscreen Wallpaper"
msgstr "Gambar Latar Layar Kunci Kustom"

msgid "Use a custom image overlay for the lockscreen background."
msgstr "Gunakan gambar kustom sebagai latar belakang layar kunci."

msgid "Wallpaper Image Path"
msgstr "Jalur Gambar Latar"

msgid "No image selected"
msgstr "Tidak ada gambar yang dipilih"

msgid "Select Image File"
msgstr "Pilih Berkas Gambar"

msgid "Select Lockscreen Wallpaper"
msgstr "Pilih Gambar Latar Layar Kunci"

msgid "Select"
msgstr "Pilih"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "Image Files"
msgstr "Berkas Gambar"

msgid "Lockscreen Mode"
msgstr "Mode Layar Kunci"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

msgid "Legacy"
msgstr "Klasik"

msgid "Cupertino"
msgstr "Cupertino"

msgid "A complete macOS Sonoma-inspired lockscreen layout (Click user-icon to switch users)."
msgstr "Tata letak layar kunci lengkap yang terinspirasi macOS Sonoma (klik ikon pengguna untuk beralih pengguna)."

msgid "macOS Sonoma-style clock over the classic, GNOME-compliant layout and flow."
msgstr "Jam bergaya macOS Sonoma di atas tata letak dan alur klasik GNOME."

msgid "Always Show User Widget"
msgstr "Selalu Tampilkan Widget Pengguna"

msgid "Hides notifications by default. Press Shift+N to show notifications."
msgstr "Sembunyikan notifikasi secara default. Tekan Shift+N untuk menampilkannya."

msgid "Prompt Vibrancy"
msgstr "Efek Visual Kolom Kata Sandi"

msgid "Adaptive color and depth enhancements for the password field."
msgstr "Peningkatan warna dan kedalaman adaptif untuk kolom kata sandi."

msgid "Tonal"
msgstr "Tonal"

msgid "Acrylic"
msgstr "Akrilik"

msgid "Lightweight, color-based mode."
msgstr "Mode ringan berbasis warna."

msgid "Advanced, blur-based mode."
msgstr "Mode lanjutan berbasis keburaman."

msgid "Show message when locked"
msgstr "Tampilkan pesan saat terkunci"

msgid "Set..."
msgstr "Atur…"

msgid "Set a message to appear on the lockscreen"
msgstr "Atur pesan yang akan ditampilkan di layar kunci"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

msgid "Unlock Crossfade"
msgstr "Transisi Memudar saat Buka Kunci"

msgid "Crossfade the lockscreen with desktop when unlocking (automatically disabled in Power Saver mode)."
msgstr "Transisi memudar antara layar kunci dan desktop saat membuka kunci (dinonaktifkan otomatis dalam mode Hemat Daya)."

msgid "Requires WACK Shell to be installed and enabled."
msgstr "Memerlukan WACK Shell untuk dipasang dan diaktifkan."

msgid "Requires WACK Shell to be enabled."
msgstr "Memerlukan WACK Shell untuk diaktifkan."

msgid "Crossfade Speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan Transisi"

msgid "Slower"
msgstr "Lebih Lambat"

msgid "Faster"
msgstr "Lebih Cepat"

msgid "Clock Animation"
msgstr "Animasi Jam"

msgid "Applied to the date and time while opening the password prompt"
msgstr "Diterapkan ke tanggal dan waktu saat membuka permintaan kata sandi"

msgid "Prompt Animation"
msgstr "Animasi Autentikasi"

msgid "Applied to the authentication prompt while it appears"
msgstr "Diterapkan ke kolom autentikasi saat muncul"

msgid "Reset Animations"
msgstr "Reset Animasi"

msgid "Restore defaults"
msgstr "Pulihkan pengaturan awal"

msgid "Reset animations"
msgstr "Reset animasi"

msgid "Scale Down"
msgstr "Perkecil Skala"

msgid "Zoom Up"
msgstr "Perbesar Skala"

msgid "Slide Up"
msgstr "Geser ke Atas"

msgid "Fade"
msgstr "Memudar"

msgid "GNOME Default"
msgstr "Default GNOME"

msgid "Rise"
msgstr "Terbit"

msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "Zoom"

msgid "Screen Timeout"
msgstr "Batas Waktu Layar"

msgid "Display and Power"
msgstr "Layar dan Daya"

msgid "Keep Screen On"
msgstr "Biarkan Layar Tetap Menyala"

msgid "Prevent the screen from immediately turning off when locked. The screen will still turn off after the normal timeout duration set in system settings."
msgstr "Mencegah layar langsung mati saat terkunci. Layar tetap akan mati setelah durasi batas waktu normal yang diatur di pengaturan sistem."

msgid "Only on AC Power"
msgstr "Hanya saat Terhubung ke Daya AC"

msgid "Only keep the screen on if the system is plugged in"
msgstr "Biarkan layar tetap menyala hanya jika sistem terhubung ke daya listrik"

msgid "Escape to Sleep / Suspend"
msgstr "Escape untuk Mematikan Layar / Tidur"

msgid "Press Escape on the lock screen to sleep display (or suspend)"
msgstr "Tekan Escape di layar kunci untuk mematikan layar (atau tidur)"

msgid "Extras"
msgstr "Fitur Tambahan"

msgid "Integrations"
msgstr "Integrasi"

msgid "[PRO] GDM Expansion"
msgstr "[PRO] GDM Expansion"

msgid "Status: Enabled. Custom layout is active on GDM."
msgstr "Status: Diaktifkan. Tata letak kustom aktif di GDM."

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Aktif"

msgid "GDM Expansion - Remove"
msgstr "Ekstensi GDM - Hapus"

msgid "Revert GDM login screen layout to GNOME Default. To uninstall, run copied command in a terminal."
msgstr "Kembalikan tata letak layar masuk GDM ke Default GNOME. Untuk mencopot pemasangan, jalankan perintah yang disalin di terminal."

msgid "Copy uninstall command to clipboard"
msgstr "Salin perintah pencopotan ke papan klip"

msgid "Copied uninstall command to clipboard!"
msgstr "Perintah pencopotan berhasil disalin ke papan klip!"

msgid "Extension is not installed system-wide in /usr/share."
msgstr "Ekstensi tidak terpasang secara sistem di /usr/share."

msgid "GDM expansion modules (src/pro) are missing system-wide."
msgstr "Modul ekstensi GDM (src/pro) tidak ditemukan di seluruh sistem."

msgid "GDM session mode is not enabled in system-wide metadata."
msgstr "Mode sesi GDM belum diaktifkan di metadata sistem."

msgid "GDM dconf override configuration (/etc/dconf/db/gdm.d) is missing."
msgstr "Konfigurasi penggantian dconf GDM (/etc/dconf/db/gdm.d) tidak ditemukan."

msgid "GDM integration is not configured."
msgstr "Integrasi GDM belum dikonfigurasi."

msgid "Status: Disabled."
msgstr "Status: Dinonaktifkan."

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Dinonaktifkan"

msgid "Enable GDM DLC Support"
msgstr "Aktifkan Dukungan DLC GDM"

msgid "Click icon to copy installer command, then run it in a terminal."
msgstr "Klik ikon untuk menyalin perintah penginstal, lalu jalankan di terminal."

msgid "Copy install command to clipboard"
msgstr "Salin perintah penginstalan ke papan klip"

msgid "Copied install command to clipboard!"
msgstr "Perintah penginstalan berhasil disalin ke papan klip!"

msgid "Upgrade to [PRO]"
msgstr "Tingkatkan ke [PRO]"

msgid "Check PRO features of this extension on this extension's GitHub repo."
msgstr "Lihat fitur PRO ekstensi ini di repositori GitHub-nya."

msgid "Visit documentation on GitHub"
msgstr "Buka dokumentasi di GitHub"

msgid "[BETA] WACK Shell Integration"
msgstr "[BETA] Integrasi WACK Shell"

msgid "Installed. Enables crossfade transitions and Cupertino-inspired shell customisations."
msgstr "Terpasang. Mengaktifkan transisi memudar dan kustomisasi Shell bergaya Cupertino."

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Terpasang"

msgid "WACK Shell - Check for Updates"
msgstr "WACK Shell - Periksa Pembaruan"

msgid "Copy check command to verify if a newer version of WACK Shell is available."
msgstr "Salin perintah untuk memeriksa ketersediaan versi WACK Shell yang lebih baru."

msgid "Copy update-check command to clipboard"
msgstr "Salin perintah pemeriksaan pembaruan"

msgid "Copied WACK Shell update-check command to clipboard!"
msgstr "Perintah pemeriksaan pembaruan WACK Shell berhasil disalin ke papan klip!"

msgid "Not installed. Install WACK Shell to unlock transition effects."
msgstr "Belum terpasang. Pasang WACK Shell untuk membuka efek transisi."

msgid "Not Installed"
msgstr "Belum Terpasang"

msgid "WACK Shell - Install"
msgstr "WACK Shell - Pasang"

msgid "Get advanced desktop crossfade transitions and Cupertino-inspired shell customisations. May contain bugs, report if found."
msgstr "Dapatkan transisi memudar desktop tingkat lanjut dan kustomisasi Shell bergaya Cupertino. Mungkin terdapat bug, laporkan jika ditemukan."

msgid "Copied WACK Shell install command to clipboard!"
msgstr "Perintah pemasangan WACK Shell berhasil disalin ke papan klip!"

msgid "Open WACK Shell repository"
msgstr "Buka repositori WACK Shell"

msgid "Clear Visual Cache"
msgstr "Bersihkan Cache Visual"

msgid "Clears temporary visual data used for wallpapers and vibrancy effects. It will be regenerated automatically."
msgstr "Menghapus data visual sementara yang digunakan untuk gambar latar dan efek visual. Data akan dibuat ulang secara otomatis."

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Bersihkan"

msgid "Clears the visual cache used for wallpapers and vibrancy effects"
msgstr "Membersihkan cache visual yang digunakan untuk gambar latar dan efek visual"

msgid "Visual cache cleared successfully!"
msgstr "Cache visual berhasil dibersihkan!"

msgid "Failed to clear cache:"
msgstr "Gagal membersihkan cache:"

